<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AnimalEye - AI Vision for Stray Animal Rescue</title>
  <style>
    body {font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #2C2C2C; background-color: #ffffff;}
    header {background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.4)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601758123927-197b3fa72b05?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1350&q=80'); background-size: cover; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 100px 20px; position: relative;}
    header a.logo-link {position: absolute; top: 20px; left: 20px;}
    header img.logo {width: 120px; border-radius: 12px; transition: transform 0.3s;}
    header img.logo:hover {transform: scale(1.05);}
    header h1 {font-size: 3em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);}
    header p {font-size: 1.3em; margin-bottom: 1em;}
    .hero-btn {background-color: white; color: #2AB7A9; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 25px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; transition: 0.3s;}
    .hero-btn:hover {background-color: #2C2C2C; color: white;}

    nav {background-color: #2C2C2C; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;}
    nav a {color: white; margin: 0 15px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; transition: color 0.3s;}
    nav a:hover {color: #2AB7A9;}

    section {padding: 60px 10%;}
    h2 {color: #2AB7A9; font-size: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.4em; text-align: center;}
    p, li {line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1.1em;}

    .features {display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 30px; margin-top: 40px; justify-content: center;}
    .feature {flex: 1 1 250px; border: 2px solid #2AB7A9; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; background: #f9f9f9; transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;}
    .feature:hover {transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}

    .feature img {width: 60px; height: 60px; margin-bottom: 10px;}

    .impact-list {display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;}
    .impact-list li {margin: 10px 0; list-style: none; background: #e6f7f5; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 20px; width: 70%; text-align: center;}

    footer {background-color: #2C2C2C; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 20px 10px;}

    /* Mobile Menu */
    .menu-toggle {display: none; flex-direction: column; cursor: pointer;}
    .bar {height: 3px; width: 25px; background-color: white; margin: 4px 0;}
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav a {display: none;}
      nav.active a {display: block; margin: 10px 0;}
      .menu-toggle {display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;}
      .features {flex-direction: column;}
      .impact-list li {width: 90%;}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a href="#top" class="logo-link"><img src="A_logo_for_a_company_named_AnimalEye_is_displayed_.png" alt="AnimalEye Logo" class="logo"></a>
    <h1 id="top">AnimalEye</h1>
    <p>AI Vision for Stray Animal Rescue</p>
    <a href="#about" class="hero-btn">Learn More</a>
  </header>

  <nav id="navbar">
    <div class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()">
      <div class="bar"></div>
      <div class="bar"></div>
      <div class="bar"></div>
    </div>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#tech">Technology</a>
    <a href="#impact">Impact</a>
    <a href="#partners">Partners</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About AnimalEye</h2>
    <p><strong>Mission:</strong> To use artificial intelligence to detect, track, and rescue stray animals in real time. AnimalEye combines compassion with technology to create safer, smarter, and more humane cities.</p>
    <p><strong>Story:</strong> Founded by Abdullah A., AnimalEye started as a project combining computer vision and social good. The team built a prototype powered by AlexNet that identifies stray dogs and cats using affordable, low-power hardware.</p>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612831455549-8f9155eaed24?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Rescued Dog" style="width:100%;border-radius:10px;margin-top:20px;">
  </section>

  <section id="tech">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/616/616408.png" alt="Camera Icon" />
        <h3>1. Detection</h3>
        <p>Camera devices capture live footage in streets or parks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/1821/1821259.png" alt="AI Icon" />
        <h3>2. AI Analysis</h3>
        <p>AlexNet-based deep learning model identifies animals and their condition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/846/846449.png" alt="Alert Icon" />
        <h3>3. Alerts</h3>
        <p>GPS coordinates and snapshots are sent to rescue teams instantly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/906/906175.png" alt="Cloud Icon" />
        <h3>4. Cloud Dashboard</h3>
        <p>Detections appear on live maps to track stray populations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="impact">
    <h2>Impact Goals</h2>
    <ul class="impact-list">
      <li>Reduce shelter intake by 25% in pilot cities.</li>
      <li>Improve rescue response time by 30%.</li>
      <li>Decrease euthanasia rates by 40% through early detection.</li>
      <li>Support One Health: human, animal, and environmental welfare.</li>
    </ul>
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574158622682-e40e69881006?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Rescue Impact" style="width:100%;border-radius:10px;margin-top:30px;">
  </section>

  <section id="partners">
    <h2>Partners & Investors</h2>
    <p>We are seeking $25,000–$50,000 in seed funding to scale our dataset, improve model accuracy, and deploy 10–20 pilot devices. Join us to bring humane AI to cities worldwide.</p>
    <a href="#contact" class="hero-btn">Join Us</a>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@animaleye.ai">contact@animaleye.ai</a></p>
    <p>Follow us on social media for updates and pilot opportunities.</p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 AnimalEye | Designed by Abdullah A.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function toggleMenu() {
      document.getElementById('navbar').classList.toggle('active');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
